          }
        ],
        "text": "Petitioners argue that Congress enacted \u00a7\u202f7609 to give the public privacy rights to notice and an opportunity to quash third\u2011party IRS summonses, and limited the exceptions."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "District Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "ed40ef933c84dc7711bb4329fc16f9eb5d364590e17b6842b44f42a142a6a6d0",
